<title>GERMANY: Bonn to issue 6-mo Bubills, 10-yr bond - Buba.</title>
<headline>Bonn to issue 6-mo Bubills, 10-yr bond - Buba.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German government will issue about nine billion marks of six-month Treasury discount paper, or Bubills, in an auction on April 16 and will also issue up to 15 billion marks of a 10-year bond next week, the Bundesbank as issuing agent said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
